{"id":"5bd8d8818dc7d0ea","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-convex-combination.md","title":"Convex Combination","display":"df-convex-combination — Convex Combination","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-convex-combination","aliases":["58-df-convex-combination"],"display":"df-convex-combination — Convex Combination","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-convex-combination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-convex-combination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-convex-combination — Convex Combination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,+,\\cdot)\">\\((V,+,\\cdot)\\)</span> (real vector space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\\)</span> (real-vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (finite nonzero index length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\\in V^n\">\\(\\bar x\\in V^n\\)</span> (finite family of points)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> (finite family of coefficients)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span> (candidate result)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvComb}_V\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvComb}_V\\)</span> (convex-combination predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex\\text{-}combination} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvComb}_V(x,\\lambda,\\bar x,n) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\bar x\\in V^n\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R^n\\land x\\in V\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\lambda(i)\\geq0)\\land\\sum_{i\\in n}\\lambda(i)=1\\land x=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\lambda(i)\\cdot\\bar x(i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex\\text{-}combination} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvComb}_V(x,\\lambda,\\bar x,n) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\bar x\\in V^n\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R^n\\land x\\in V\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\lambda(i)\\geq0)\\land\\sum_{i\\in n}\\lambda(i)=1\\land x=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\lambda(i)\\cdot\\bar x(i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Convex sets are closed under convex combinations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(V,+,\\cdot)$ (real vector space, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)$ (real-vector-space predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(V,+,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x\\in V^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvComb}_V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex\\text{-}combination} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvComb}_V(x,\\lambda,\\bar x,n) \\leftrighta